# Installed as /etc/apport/report-ignore/lexleaf by the Lexleaf Debian package.
#
# Ubuntu's crash reporter (Apport) offers to "relaunch" a crashed program by
# running the crashed process's own command line again. For one of Lexleaf's
# helper processes that starts a Chromium zygote with no application behind
# it, which loops forever writing an error to the system log until the disk
# is full. Listing the executable here stops Apport from handling it.
/opt/Lexleaf/lexleaf
